   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: more hosted suites fail on the iPhone Duo simulator on plain `dev-swift` (0ee441bf), measured by w824:\n- `ListLookHostedTests` dense: 12 issues (this issue);\n- `FavoritesUnreadFilterTests`: 1 issue;\n- `AccountMenuPlacementTests`: 1 issue.\n\nSame likely cause: they assume an iPhone width or layout. Cover them here, or split this issue if the cause differs.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
